# Low Water: the build layer's tools, clothing and bench work (design/SYSTEMS-FULL.md section 19).
# Director's file, 2026-10-17. Included by all three acts. The six Act 1 tools first written in
# combat.lwd keep their records there, with the build fields added; this file adds the fifteen
# new tools. Movesets: SYSTEMS-FULL 19.5a.
# needs: compartment or voice values; scale: voice strong|fair|slight; special: the tool's art,
# paid from Composure (the engine's grit); fittings: the bench options, one per tool.

@weapon w.lantern
name: A storm lantern
class: use
weight: 1
reach: 6
condition: 3
moves: throw, hold_up
special: douse_and_throw
needs: none
scale: none
fittings: shutter | spare_fill

@weapon w.rope
name: A coil of rope
class: use
weight: 1
reach: 4
condition: 4
moves: throw_legs, lasso_tool
special: tie
needs: none
scale: grip slight
fittings: weighted_ends | tarred

