# ---------------------------------------------------------------- items for the new tools
@item temper.step
name: A temper step
about: Applied to the tool in hand at the bench: its temper rises by one.

@item fitting.step
name: A fitting
about: Applied to the tool in hand at the bench: the fitting chosen from its list.

@item w.lantern_tool
name: A storm lantern, to throw
slot: hand
about: Thrown, it lights the ground and can fire spilled oil.

@item w.marlinspike
name: A marlinspike
slot: hand
about: Short iron for knots and rivets. Finds the gap in anything strapped.

@item w.eelspear
name: An eel spear
slot: hand
about: Three tines on an ash haft. Holds a person at reach in water.

@item w.crowbar
name: A stripper's crowbar
slot: hand
about: Pries and hooks. A heavy pulls a guard down.

@item w.chain
name: A tide-warden's chain
slot: hand
about: Board iron. Wraps a leg and drags toward water.

@item w.oar
name: An oar
slot: hand
about: A wide sweep in water, and it floats.

@item w.belljar
name: A Congregation bell jar, carried
slot: hand
about: A helmet you hold. It catches, and it rings.

@item w.beetle
name: A cooper's beetle
slot: hand
about: The heaviest thing in Gullet that is still a tool.

@item w.fid
name: Hester's fid
slot: hand
about: A splicing spike, worn smooth by one hand for forty years.

@item w.oldkey
name: The Old Light's bronze key
slot: hand
about: A hundred years of salt. It has never bent.

@item w.spanner
name: A gasholder spanner
slot: hand
about: Two heads; a heavy turns the person it lands on.

@item w.tiller
name: A boat's tiller
slot: hand
about: Swings low. Downwind, the gale makes it fly.

@item w.salt
name: A sack of salt
slot: hand
about: Thrown, it blinds. On ice, it is footing for one.

@item c.apron
name: A stripper's leather apron
slot: coat
about: Protection 3, weight 3. The Low Company reads it.

@item c.seaboots
name: A tide-warden's sea boots
slot: feet
about: Protection 2, weight 3. Poise +1 on wet stone.

@item c.guernsey
name: Hester's knitted guernsey
slot: neck
about: Protection 1, weight 1. Cold rises slower; warm even wet.

@item s.bronze
name: Old bronze
about: Salvage of the last tier: a tool's fifth temper. Rare; every piece is a piece the town does not get.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the bench: temper and fittings
@recipe t.temper1
name: Temper a tool, first step (tin and cork)
in: s.tin 1
in: s.cork 1
out: temper.step 1
when: at(room) | at(mole_steps) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 10

@recipe t.temper2
name: Temper a tool, second step (tin)
in: s.tin 2
out: temper.step 1
when: at(room) | at(mole_steps) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 15

@recipe t.temper3
name: Temper a tool, third step (brass and copper)
in: s.brass 1
in: s.copper_wire 1
out: temper.step 1
when: at(room) | at(mole_steps) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 20

@recipe t.temper4
name: Temper a tool, fourth step (brass)
in: s.brass 2
in: s.copper_wire 1
out: temper.step 1
when: at(room) | at(mole_steps) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 25

@recipe t.temper5
name: Temper a tool, fifth step (old bronze)
in: s.bronze 1
out: temper.step 1
when: at(room) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 30

@recipe t.fitting
name: Fit a tool (its fitting list)
in: s.brass 1
out: fitting.step 1
when: at(room) | at(mole_steps) | at(weigh_in) | at(gas_vestry)
cost: 15
